## 8. Creating Route Tables
Every VPC Has a Main Route Table

STEPS TO CREATE ROUTE TABLE:
Step - 1: VPC → Route Tables → Create route table
Enter Name - MediVault-Production-RT; Select VPC; Click Create
MediVault-Management-RT
Step - 2: Associate route tables with subnets
VPC → Route Tables → MediVault-Production-RT
Subnet associations → Edit subnet associations

