## 9. Creating Internet Gateway
An Internet Gateway (IGW) is the component that provides a VPC a path to/from the Internet.
Creating an Internet Gateway does not automatically make a subnet public.
We need
Internet Gateway
        +
Route: 0.0.0.0/0 → Internet Gateway

STEPS TO CREATE INTERNET GATEWAY
Step - 1: VPC → Internet Gateways
MediVault-IGW
Step - 2: Attach it to medivault vpc

