## 10. Creating S3 Gateway VPC Endpoint

STEPS TO CREATE VPC ENDPOINT
Step - 1: VPC → Endpoints → Create endpoint
MediVault-S3-Endpoint
Step - 2: Select AWS services - S3 with type Gateway
Step - 3: Choose VPC - MediVault-VPC
Step - 4: Configure Route Table
MediVault-Production-RT
Step - 5: Choose endpoint policy (MediVault-Production-RT)

